    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>符号执行开销重；边界二进制过滤漏报；CPF覆盖不全导致BDG断裂</p>

